<section class="not-content">
  <h2>Why Go?</h2>
  <p>The first version of Mobius was in Rust. The Rust builds took a long time, and each agent waited for each build and each check. Mobius is now in Go. Go builds fast, so an agent gets the result of its check sooner and does more work in one hour.</p>
</section>

